if {metMikazuki} == true:
	jump leaveHouse
if {reverse} == true:
	The girl seems to notice you walking very oddly. Shaking her head, she gives you a green concoction.
	1 *GREEN CONCOCTION* obtained!
	Drink it?
	- Glug glug glug
		A turning sensation fills your stomach...
		When it subsides, you feel much better!
		set {reverse} = false
		[signal arg="player_normal"]
	- Ew no
		You just cannot bring yourself to do it!
		You pretend to sip on it instead.
You sit down for supper...
[background scene="res://Scenes/Transition.tscn" fade="0.0"]
[wait time="1.0"]
As you dig into some delicious lamb chops, the girl leaves.
All alone, something tugs at your heartstrings as you recall her past, flooding over you like a wave\:
A poor child, forsaken and sold by her parents to the royal family.
And yet, her courage was how she climbed the ranks to become the Imperial Shogun...
...all without harboring a single drop of resentment in her pure heart.
Oh, to be a cool sword girl living in a quaint house in a quaint field.
[wait time="1.5"]
You dutifully finish your supper and prepare to go find the sword girl outside.
label leaveHouse
Leave the house?
- Yes
	[signal arg="leave_house"]
- Not yet
set {metMikazuki} = true